WP10014","armor":"WP1009505","helmet":"WP1026105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10060","city":"CS1009","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[66,51,63,65,61,38],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"120","reputation":"14650","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1009505","helmet":"WP1026105"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[{"kind":"plot","id":"1025102","name":{"zh":"邺城丽人","en":"The Beauty of Ye"},"year":"203","month":"9","desc":{"zh":"进入邺城后，曹丕遇到洛神甄姬，想占为己有......\n\n禁忌条件：主角为甄宓丈夫，曹操，曹丕，甄宓，刘氏，袁绍，袁谭，袁熙，袁尚时无法触发。\n\n亲历条件：【身属曹操势力】、【甄宓为其他势力武将】、【甄宓，曹丕，曹操存活】且【邺城属曹操】\n\n逆天改命：【<与甄宓的关系等级达到2级>阻止曹丕强娶甄宓，并使甄宓成为家将】","en":"Upon entering Yecheng, Cao Pi encounters Lady Zhen, peerless as the Luo River Goddess, and desires to take her for himself...\n\n\n\nIneligible Conditions: Cannot trigger if the protagonist is Lady Zhen's husband, Cao Cao, Cao Pi, Lady Zhen, Lady Liu, Yuan Shao, Yuan Tan, Yuan Xi, or Yuan Shang.\n\n\n\nParticipation Condition: 【Belong to Cao Cao's Faction】, 【Lady Zhen is an Officer of another Faction】, 【Lady Zhen, Cao Pi, and Cao Cao are alive】, and 【Yecheng belongs to Cao Cao】\n\n\n\nDefy Fate: 【<Relationship level with Lady Zhen reaches Level 2> Prevent Cao Pi from forcing Lady Zhen into marriage, and recruit Lady Zhen as a Retainer】"}},{"kind":"plot","id":"1004208","name":{"zh":"甄宓完婚","en":"Zhen Mi's Wedding"},"year":"198","month":"3","desc":{"zh":"","en":""}},{"kind":"plot","id":"1000608","name":{"zh":"甄宓离异","en":"Zhen Mi's Divorce"},"year":"206","month":"3","desc":{"zh":"","en":""}}],"biography":{"zh":"袁绍次子，甄姬之夫。袁绍击败公孙瓒后任命幽州刺史，接纳了前来求助的袁尚。曹操进攻幽州时又与袁尚一起逃往乌丸，后又逃至辽东投靠公孙康，但被其杀害，将二人首级献于曹操。","tc":"袁紹次子，甄姬之夫。袁紹擊敗公孫瓚后任命幽州刺史，接納了前來求助的袁尚。曹操進攻幽州時又與袁尚一起逃往烏丸，后又逃至遼東投靠公孫康，但被其殺害，將二人首級獻于曹操。","en":"Second son of Yuan Shao and husband of Lady Zhen. After Yuan Shao defeated Gongsun Zan, Yuan Xi was appointed Lt. Governor of You Province. He took in his younger brother Yuan Shang when the latter came seeking refuge. When Cao Cao attacked You Province, Yuan Xi and Yuan Shang fled together to the Wuwan territory. They later fled again to Liaodong to seek asylum with Gongsun Kang, who killed them both and sent their heads to Cao Cao.","jp":"袁紹の次男。甄姫の夫。袁紹が公孫瓚を破った後に幽州刺史に任じられ、助けを求めてきた袁尚を受け入れた。曹操が幽州へ侵攻すると袁尚と共に烏丸へ逃れ、さらに遼東の公孫康を頼ったが殺害され、二人の首級は曹操に献上された。","kr":"원소의 차남이자 견희의 남편입니다. 원소가 공손찬을 격파한 후 유주자사에 임명되었으며, 도움을 청하러 온 원상을 맞아들였습니다. 조조가 유주를 공격하자 원상과 함께 오환으로 달아났고, 이후 다시 요동으로 달아나 공손강에게 의탁했으나 살해당했으며 두 사람의 수급은 조조에게 바쳐졌습니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10372","remark":"","surname":"袁","surnameTc":"袁","surnameEn":"Yuan","surnameJp":"袁","surnameKr":"원","surnameOther":"","name":"熙","nameTc":"熙","nameEn":"Xi","nameJp":"熙","nameKr":"희","nameOther":"","word":"显奕","wordTc":"顯奕","wordEn":"Xianyi","wordJp":"顕奕","wordKr":"현혁","wordOther":"","icon":"袁熙","power":"WJ10060","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"190","city":"CS1009","gender":"0","rule":"66","force":"51","wise":"63","politics":"65","charm":"61","will":"38","ruleTalent":"7","forceTalent":"4","wiseTalent":"6","politicsTalent":"7","charmTalent":"6","willTalent":"3","weaponMaster":"19/19/53/19/19/49/50/19","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"4300","battleSoulPoint":"2600","debateSoulPoint":"3900","strategy":"1013915","strategy2":"1009901","professions":"0/0/2/1/1/0/2/2/0/2/1/2/0/1/0/1/2/0/1/1/0/0/2/0","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"4","compatible":"67","loyalty":"120","reputation":"14650","evaluate":"-2000","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"176","show":"190","death":"207","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"1","type":"1","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1